---
layout: layout.jinja
title: Our snacks
description: Six trail snacks made in Pine Cone Gap, West Virginia, from Pine Cone Crunch to Bigfoot Jerky. By the bag, or in a monthly subscription.
---
<Section id="all" level="1" title="Every snack in the pantry" intro="Six snacks, all made in small batches in Pine Cone Gap, West Virginia. Buy them by the bag, or get them every month in a subscription.">
	<div class="grid">
		{%- for snack in snacks %}
		<Card level="2" title="{{ snack.name }}" href="/provisions/{{ snack.slug }}/" image="{{ snack.image }}" alt="{{ snack.imageAlt }}" eyebrow="{{ snack.price | money }} · {{ snack.weight }}">
			<p>{{ snack.tagline }}</p>
		</Card>
		{%- endfor %}
	</div>
</Section>
